  <div class="container">
    <p class="eyebrow">My services</p>
    <h2>Three ways to work with me.</h2>
    <div class="offer-grid">

      <article class="offer-card">
        <div class="num">01</div>
        <h3>Speaking</h3>
        <p>Keynotes, MC, and panels on resilience, disability inclusion, and how teams really learn. For conferences, off-sites, and leadership events that want more than inspirational fluff.</p>
        <a href="/speaking">Speaking &rarr;</a>
      </article>

      <article class="offer-card">
        <div class="num">02</div>
        <h3>Coaching</h3>
        <p>Executive coaching for senior leaders navigating change and looking to lead more authentically. Career coaching for people rebuilding professional momentum after a break. Virtual or in person in Dublin.</p>
        <a href="/coaching">Coaching &rarr;</a>
      </article>

      <article class="offer-card">
        <div class="num">03</div>
        <h3>Consulting</h3>
        <p>Strategy work for companies whose L&amp;D, leadership, and inclusion practices aren't pulling their weight. I rebuild functions, design programmes that stick, and set up the ERGs and frameworks that change how people actually work.</p>
        <a href="/consulting">Consulting &rarr;</a>
