<section class="mini-about">
  <div class="mini-about-grid">
    <div class="mini-about-photo">
      <img src="Personal/With%20Mojo.JPG" alt="Sacha laughing with her dog Mojo" />
    </div>
    <div class="mini-about-text">
      <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
      <p class="lead">I am Phoenix because I had to be.</p>
      <p>In 2015 a surgery that was supposed to be straightforward went wrong and left me paralysed down my left side. I was told my life as I knew it was over. I decided differently. Eleven months later I was back at work. Two years later I walked on the Great Wall of China.</p>
      <p>That experience, and the resilience it asked of me, is what I now build my work around. Not only the big rocks we climb, but the pebbles that threaten to trip us up.</p>
      <a href="/about" class="about-link">Read the full story &rarr;</a>
